   "text": "the paper's reports at every level (b10 s09-D02): the Board's research questions (board.md ## Questions,\ns01-D08) each with a report; a version Job's standing questions every send answers (haipipe-paper-workflow)\nand its comments and review rounds (haipipe-paper-comments); a Section's own questions. This topic settles\nwhere a review round and its answers live, and what each paper level must report.",
