   "text": "? A review round: a report in the version Job, or Tasks in the same Job? (Q03)\n? A resubmission elsewhere: a new version Job with its own reports?\n? Section › Comments: the comments report's concern table as it is, or a ## Review Items table? (was s33 open 2)\n? What a Section must report (the Board and the version: s05-D02)\n? RQ0 to RQ6 and Q00 to Q06 are the same Questions: show one name?",
